## Why This Is Asked

Tests ownership, bias-for-action, and customer-obsession in a privacy-risk incident requiring cross-functional coordination and rapid containment.

## Key Concepts

- Cross-functional incident response and escalation
- Tenant-scoped controls and safe toggles without data loss
- Privacy, auditability, and regulatory implications
- Clear customer and leadership communication; postmortems and preventive controls

## Code Example

```javascript
